# Testing

Pyramid: many unit tests, few end-to-end happy paths.

Unit: Vitest + Testing Library, colocated `*.test.ts(x)`. Prefer `getByRole` and accessible-name queries. Update those tests when behavior changes.

E2E: Playwright under `e2e/[domain]/`.

Structure tests as Given / When / Then:

```ts
describe("<Button />", () => {
  describe("when clicked", () => {
    it("calls the handler", () => {
      /* arrange / act / assert */
    });
  });
});
```

Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/TESTING_CONVENTION.md`, `docs/frontend/tools/TESTING.md`
